        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional Equestrian Property on C6.91 Acres\r\nCurrinah, Ballaghaderreen, Co. Roscommon F45 E402:\r\n\r\nPresented in immaculate condition throughout, this attractive detached bungalow stands on C0.81 acres of beautifully maintained grounds and is offered for sale together with an additional C6.1 acres of quality land, making it an ideal opportunity for horse enthusiasts seeking a ready-made equestrian home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious and well-appointed comprising:\r\n•\tWelcoming entrance hall with tiled and carpeted flooring. \r\n•\tFully fitted and tiled open-plan kitchen/dining/living room, complete with patio doors leading to the back of the property. \r\n•\tSitting room featuring a striking fireplace and solid wood flooring. \r\n•\tUtility room with tiled flooring. \r\n•\tThree generous bedrooms, including a master bedroom with en-suite. \r\n•\tFully tiled family bathroom fitted with a luxurious Jacuzzi bath. \r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n•\tPVC double-glazed windows throughout. \r\n•\tTarmacadam driveway. \r\n•\tWell-maintained gardens surrounding the residence. \r\n\r\nOutstanding Equestrian Facilities\r\n\r\nA standout feature of this property is its superb equestrian infrastructure, offering everything required for private use, training or competition preparation. \r\n\r\nThe extensive facilities include:\r\n•\tApproximately 6.1 acres of adjoining land. \r\n•\tThree stables and a tack room, opening onto a small paddock. \r\n•\tAn open shed with three divisions, providing excellent storage and versatility. \r\n•\tA professionally designed arena with a sand and rubber surface, complete with floodlighting for year-round use. \r\n•\tA cross-country course set within the lands, providing an exceptional training environment rarely found in residential offerings. \r\n\r\nCombining a turnkey family home with first-class equestrian amenities, this unique property presents an outstanding opportunity for those with a passion for horses, whether for leisure riding, training or competition.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality of the residence and the exceptional range of equestrian facilities on offer."
      },
